<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80151" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάχν-η</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήγνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hoar-frost, rime</i> (defined as frozen rain, <i><span class="en">
				Posidon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				7.153
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.476
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἑῴα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐπὶ γῆς συμπαγὲν ἐκ δρόσου
					γενόμενον π. λέγεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					59e
				</span></i>
			 ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρύσταλλος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Theognet.
				1.3
			</span></i> : pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάχναι καὶ χάλαζαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					188b
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπέκαυσεν ἡ π. τὰς ἀμπέλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philippid.
					25.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γήρως εὐρῶτα καὶ πάχνην</span> the
			mould and <i>frost</i> of age, descriptive of an old man's grey
			hair, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				650a
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				381
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κουροβόρος</span>
			<i>clotted blood</i> of the eaten children, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1512
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
